  "body_html": "<p>Marsk, Mannskapet ditt teller i utgangspunktet et halvt dusin. Behandle dem som en følgesvenn med merkelappen <em>gruppe</em> . Alle startverdier her kan endre seg i løpet av spillet.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">Mannskapet</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Maks HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Maks HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Rustning\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Rustning</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Skade\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Slå skade\">Skade</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">HP starter på 6 hver; Rustning på 0; Skade på d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Merkelapper</h3>\n<p>Mannskapet ditt starter med <em>gruppe</em>, en merkelapp fra bakgrunnen din, pluss 2 til etter eget valg.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>bueskyttere</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>atletiske</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>tapre</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>lure</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>hengivne</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Starter avkrysset\"> <span><em>gruppe</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>hardføre</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>skremmende</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>oppmerksomme</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>tålmodige</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>respekterte</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>snikende</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>krigere</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>enestående</em> (krever Helter til det Siste)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Instinkt</h3>\n<p>Velg 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>Å kjekle, strides innbyrdes og bære nag</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>Å holde på tradisjon og overtro</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>Å gi etter for sine lavere instinkter</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>Å herse med andre</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>Å ta unødige sjanser</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>Å gå for langt</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Pris</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Velg 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Lojalitet</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Lojalitet 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Lojalitet 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Lojalitet 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Lojalitet 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Lojalitet 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Lojalitet 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Lystighet, i samlet flokk</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Offentlig anerkjennelse og respekt, ære</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Sjanser tatt, av deg, for å hjelpe dem</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Seire vunnet over verdige fiender</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Rikdom vunnet til dem selv eller Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"eget forslag\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Oppakning</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ eller færre er lett bør; 4–6 ◇ er normal bør; 7–9 ◇ er tung bør.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Øks</strong>, jern (<em>hånd</em>, <em>kastevåpen</em>, x gjennomborende)</li><li>◇ <strong>Spyd</strong>, jern (<em>tett</em>, <em>kastevåpen</em>, x gjennomborende)</li><li>◇ <strong>Bue &amp; jernpiler</strong> (<em>nær</em>, x gjennomborende, ○ få piler, ○ tomt for piler)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Skjold</strong> (+1 rustning, +1 Beredskap på 7+ ved Forsvar)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Tykke huder</strong> (1 rustning, <em>varm</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Kappe</strong> (<em>varm</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Forsyninger</strong> (4+Velstand bruk per mann)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Forsyninger</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Bruk 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Bruk 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Bruk 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Bruk 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Bruk 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Bruk 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Bruk 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Bruk 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Bruk 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Bruk 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Bruk 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Bruk 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Bruk 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Bruk 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Bruk 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Bruk 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Bruk 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Bruk 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Bruk 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Bruk 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Bruk 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Bruk 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Bruk 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Bruk 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Bruk 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Bruk 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Bruk 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Bruk 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Bruk 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Bruk 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Bruk 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Bruk 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Bruk 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"Bruk 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"Bruk 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"Bruk 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"Bruk 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"Bruk 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"Bruk 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"Bruk 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"Bruk 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"Bruk 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"Bruk 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"Bruk 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"Bruk 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"Bruk 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"Bruk 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"Bruk 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Annet utstyr</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">Enkeltpersoner</h3>\n<p>Når én utmerker seg, gi vedkommende et navn, en merkelapp og ett eller flere kjennetegn.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkelapp</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"merkelapp\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kjennetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kjennetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkelapp</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"merkelapp\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kjennetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kjennetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkelapp</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"merkelapp\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kjennetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kjennetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkelapp</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"merkelapp\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kjennetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kjennetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkelapp</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"merkelapp\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kjennetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kjennetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Navn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"navn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkelapp</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"merkelapp\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Kjennetegn</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"kjennetegn\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>Navn:</strong> Aled, Culhwich, Eira, Gerat, Glaw, Harri, Lowri, Mervyn, Nesta</p>\n<p><strong>Merkelapper:</strong> <em>dyrevenn, diger, bølle, kynisk, drukkenbolt, ivrig, spillefugl, grådig, gretten, godtroende, hjerteknuser, ærlig, vennlig, rå, liten, naiv, gammel, godt likt, stolt, ferskvare, dumdristig, skamløs, skarpøyd, hissig</em></p>\n<p><strong>Kjennetegn:</strong> ___s barn/søsken/forelder/søskenbarn/___, skallet, forelsket i ___, nag til ___, hater ___, forguder ___, spøker, rotete, mangler øye/finger/hånd/___, savner ungene sine, mareritt, nygift, from, arr, radmager, skarp tunge, synger, snorker, forteller skrøner, for alvorlig, trøbbel hjemme, plystrer, spikker</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notater</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notater\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">Befal Følgesvenner</h3>\n<p>Når du <strong><em>befaler dem å gjøre et trekk, og de gjør det</em></strong>, slå +1 i stedet for +EGENSKAP hvis noen av merkelappene deres gjelder (eller +2 om de attpåtil er <em>enestående</em>). Gjelder ingen merkelapper, slå +0. Ville noen av merkelappene deres stå i veien, slå med ulempe.</p>\n<p>Når de er <strong><em>uten ordrer</em></strong> , eller de <strong><em>handler på eget initiativ</em></strong>, sier spillederen hva de gjør og hvordan det går.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">Styrk Båndet</h3>\n<p>Når du <strong><em>betaler prisen deres</em></strong> , og du ikke nylig har gjort det, holder de +1 Lojalitet (høyst 3).</p>\n<p>Bruk Lojaliteten deres 1 for 1 til å få dem til å:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Overvinne frykten sin og gjøre som du sier</li><li>La være å handle etter instinktet/merkelappene/trekkene sine</li><li>Gjøre noe de ikke vil (så lenge det ikke er avskyelig eller selvmorderisk)</li></ul>"
}
